[I] Cross-platform scripting library

[T] The AngelCode Scripting Library, or AngelScript as it is also known, is an
[T] extremely flexible cross-platform scripting library designed to allow
[T] applications to extend their functionality through external scripts. It has
[T] been designed from the beginning to be an easy to use component, both for
[T] the application programmer and the script writer.

[U] https://www.angelcode.com/angelscript/

[A] Andreas Jönsson <andreas@angelcode.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[L] ZLIB
[V] 2.39.0

[D] f2cc69d4078bceb9a021de5a8aa72283b209feee87e0063d6f55521a angelscript_2.39.0.zip https://www.angelcode.com/angelscript/sdk/files/

